281	     * digits following the leading region of {@code '<REGION><FY><HASH8><CHK>'}), so it references the
282	     * same fiscal year embedded in the member id. Only when no member id is present does it fall back to
283	     * computing the fiscal year from the business-day-adjusted registration date. Returns {@code null}
284	     * when neither a member id nor a registration date is available.
